  "description": "<p>Allows you to start ITAR? early, and with no fence standing required. Get your box of goodies filled up before Collector way before you need it.</p>\n<p>I personally think Collector should be something you build up to, but it should be a task you “start” long before you start. Thank you to the Get Collector Early dev for giving me the idea for this one.</p>\n<p>This mod has just one config option, the level at which it is available to you.</p>\n<p>Default value is 1, but after running the server for the first time with the mod, the config will generate for you and you’ll be able to edit it.</p>\n",
